Error [E1110]: `Group` cannot be stored in a struct field
  --> tests/ui/taskgroup_parameter_field.jet:2:5
    |
  2 |     group: Group
    |     ^^^^^
 Why: a task group is a scoped spawn authority, not a value that can escape its call stack
 Fix: pass `group: Group` directly to a helper function or method instead
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E1110
